{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>במראות</b> Four times in the Masorah: במראות הצובאות · ויאמר אלהים · לישראל במראות · במראות אלהים — two in Ezekiel. The women had turned away from the desire of the world and gave their mirrors for the dedication of the Tabernacle, and the spirit of Elohim rested upon them." "<b>הצובאות</b> Twice: במראות הצובאות אשר ישכבון — \"the women הצובאות\" by the sons of Eli, just as there \"the women הצובאות would lie down,\" so too here — by means of the mirrors the women would lie with them, as stated in the Midrash: they would adorn themselves with mirrors and entice their husbands, who would consort with them."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:14.046839145Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}